# Missionary Moblin (otherAreas 103): Oldton Movalpolos' Koblakiq (no script; default event 13). A Soiled Letter and a
# Chocobo Feather. Available: a trade of the letter: no trade handler (the letter kept; nothing). Koblakiq 7, option 0
# and 2: nothing; option 1: begun. Accepted: 8 (event). The letter traded: 9, finished: completed (4000 gil), the letter
# taken, the mustZone set (Oldton Movalpolos). Completed with the mustZone: 12. A rezone (the same zone): the mustZone
# kept (the zone-in clears it only in another zone): 12 again. A warp to Castle Oztroja and back: cleared: Missionary's
# section off; For the Birds' offer: 14 (0, Arnica Root), finished with option 0: nothing.
lists OldtonMovalpolos/Koblakiq/onTrigger OldtonMovalpolos/Koblakiq/onTrade OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/7 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/9 OldtonMovalpolos/onEventFinish/14
char zone=OldtonMovalpolos pos=-63.4,22.8,-117.5 job=WAR lvl=75
item SoiledLetter
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Koblakiq SoiledLetter x1          # available: no trade handler; nothing (the letter kept)
trigger Koblakiq                        # available: 7
finish option=0                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Koblakiq                        # 7
finish option=2                         # not 1: nothing
trigger Koblakiq                        # 7
finish option=1                         # begun
trigger Koblakiq                        # accepted: 8
finish
trade Koblakiq ChocoboFeather x1        # no letter: nil; nothing (no trade default)
trade Koblakiq SoiledLetter x1          # the letter: 9
finish                                  # completed; 4000 gil; the letter taken; mustZone 11
trigger Koblakiq                        # completed, mustZone: 12
finish
rezone                                  # the same zone: the mustZone kept
trigger Koblakiq                        # 12 again
finish
warp -156.5,-17.2,193.5 CastleOztroja   # another zone: the mustZone cleared
warp -63.4,22.8,-117.5 OldtonMovalpolos
trigger Koblakiq                        # Missionary off; For the Birds: 14 (0, 1663)
finish option=0                         # nothing
